[00:00.00][by:Kongfuxu]
[00:22.29]Dreamt of a doorway
[00:22.29]梦到一个任意门
[00:26.91]That opened to everything
[00:26.91]可以得到任何东西
[00:32.01]And I'm reaching towards it
[00:32.01]我像它走去
[00:35.00]Drifting backwards
[00:35.00]但只是向后漂流
[00:35.56]Drawing the curtains
[00:35.56]拉下窗帘
[00:46.98]Windows inside my head
[00:46.98]我脑中的窗子
[00:51.29]Maybe I'm only making mirrors
[00:51.29]也许一切都是我臆想的幻境
